 It was interesting.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:54.540
"How much are you involved in 
the creation of the music videos?"

00:09:54.540 --> 00:10:02.300
For the most part, 
the film director makes the decisions.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.300
