I was the primary subject 
of the video I made.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:54.920
All the other members turned into me.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.730
So this time, I wouldn't be in it.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:02.130
I'd rather think about 
what I'd have everyone else do.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.880
And you wouldn't be in it?

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:05.270
You wouldn't be playing instruments. 
You'd be acting instead.

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:06.140
